00:02:43.760 --> 00:02:50.180
or greater year-over-year jumps. This approach also surfaces second-order beneficiaries in the AI

00:02:50.180 --> 00:02:56.320
supply chain, where similar productivity gains may appear later in the cycle. Historical data shows

00:02:56.320 --> 00:03:02.300
